  "academyNote": "Academy, free and voluntary aided schools can set their own term dates, so please check with your school.",
  "localFacts": [
    {"fact": "Wokingham numbers its year in six terms (Term 1 to Term 6) and gives the number of days in each.", "source": "https://www.wokingham.gov.uk/sites/wokingham/files/2025-03/School%20term%20dates%20calendar%202026%20to%202027.pdf"},
    {"fact": "Of the five INSET days, the council sets one as the first day of Term 1 (Tuesday 1 September 2026); the other four are set by each school within the 195 days and communicated to parents.", "source": "https://www.wokingham.gov.uk/sites/wokingham/files/2025-03/School%20term%20dates%20calendar%202026%20to%202027.pdf"},
    {"fact": "In 2027-28 the council's INSET day is Thursday 2 September 2027 and pupils start on Friday 3 September.", "source": "https://www.wokingham.gov.uk/sites/wokingham/files/2026-09/School-term-dates-calendar-2027-to-2028.pdf"},
    {"fact": "In 2027-28 Term 4 runs to Friday 7 April 2028 and the spring holiday is Monday 10 to Friday 21 April 2028, so the summer term starts on Monday 24 April, a week after Easter Monday.", "source": "https://www.wokingham.gov.uk/sites/wokingham/files/2026-09/School-term-dates-calendar-2027-to-2028.pdf"},
    {"fact": "The 2027-28 PDF text names Wednesday 1 September 2027 as the first day of Term 1, but its calendar shades 1 September as a school holiday and 2 September as the INSET day.", "source": "https://www.wokingham.gov.uk/sites/wokingham/files/2026-09/School-term-dates-calendar-2027-to-2028.pdf"},
    {"fact": "Teacher Training Days (INSET) are specified by the headteacher and governors of each school.", "source": "https://www.wokingham.gov.uk/schools-and-education/school-information-and-services/schools-and-education/school-information-and-services/school-term-dates-and-school-holidays"}
